ab0bb12de93506d4b979977b380b80e46128a21e, written by Neverdecel and licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the LICENSE file in this directory. The
upstream repository https://github.com/Neverdecel/CodeRAG is no longer public.

Codalith keeps the chunker, embedding providers, LanceDB store, and hybrid search,
modified to index one immutable source snapshot into a fresh store and to read
existing stores. The original CLI, HTTP API, web UI, MCP server, installer,
filesystem watcher, incremental re-indexing, ignore-rule walking, progress
reporting, evaluation harness, LLM answer surface, cross-encoder reranker, and
call-graph expansion were not included.
